5,1,1,talk,Shion,,We need a logical way to decide this. I suggest we look at the actual impact the room has on our workspace before choosing.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I agree. I think it would be helpful to see some of the costs and figures first, if that's okay.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know who actually uses the room! It feels like it's always a mystery who is in there.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Servas,,Let us not forget the human element. A room is more than its function; it is a place for connection.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,Efficiency is key. I am interested in the labor and time spent on maintenance and movement.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Servas, connection is fine, but noise and mess are the real issues. I'll be checking those specific points.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Toshio, do you think the invoices would show where the time goes, or just the money?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,I'm going to look at the fridge and the tally! I bet it's a mess in there.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Rin, your energy is wonderful. I shall look into how we communicate, or rather, how we fail to.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Daisuke, invoices show the cost of failure. I will look into the facilities callouts and the actual time spent walking.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
