60,3,1,talk,Shion,,Option B is the only one that addresses the rental costs and the lack of professional privacy.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I've seen the figures. Option B is a higher upfront cost, but it stops the monthly rental payments.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Rin,,"If we go with B, can we promise that the people by the door don't just take it all the time?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Servas,,"The shared calendar in Option B provides the fairness you seek, Rin, and the privacy we all need.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Toshio,,Option B is the most efficient. It removes the need for outside travel for meetings and avoids kitchen upkeep.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Shion,,I'm voting for B. It's the most logical conclusion based on the noise and the costs.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I'll vote for B too. It feels like the safest choice for the budget.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Rin,,"Okay, B it is! As long as there's a calendar so I can get in there too!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Servas,,I concur. A space for meaningful conversation is the greatest gift we can give our working relationship.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Toshio,,B is the most sustainable choice for our time and resources.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
